  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.28: fixes a 1.0.27 regression where kerned themed PDF footers printed \"N of ___TOTAL__\" instead of the page count (running content is now written once the page count is known). Also, from comparing the text layer with asciidoctor-pdf: line breaks after hyphens, wrapping that broke some lines one word early, admonitions split across pages, table header text colour after a codespan, default heading/link/code-block colours, TOC dot leaders and page-number links, outline entries and roman page labels for the title page. See CHANGELOG.md.",
